cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Ballast, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Ballast AI Security Framework"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  The Ballast AI Security Framework is an open, vendor-neutral security
  control framework for enterprises that build, buy and use AI, covering
  copilots and assistants,
  autonomous agents, AI coding assistants, AI features embedded in SaaS, and
  externally sourced models. Version 1.0.0, the first public release, defines
  128 controls in eight domains, applied by capability tags, tiered by asset
  risk rating and autonomy level, and mapped to the OWASP Top 10 lists for
  LLM and agentic applications, MITRE ATLAS, NIST AI RMF and ISO/IEC 42001.
authors:
